I know the Shadow Road is dangerous, but we cannot let the monsters that attacked Pillai start a new attack on the continent. We are still recovering from the damage Midranda caused.

Please, help the Royal Mages fight the monsters on the Shadow Road.
I had to lower your attack power by 30% so you do not draw too much of the monsters' attention.

Hunt 80 monsters on the Shadow Road, among them the Inferno, the Rusty Guardian or the Mysterious Shadow.
When you are done, talk to the Royal Mage on the Road to the Wind.
